<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Privacy Policy | ShouldISpend</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Read the privacy policy for ShouldISpend financial calculators and decision tools."
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f5f7fa;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --text: #0d1b2a;
        --muted: #64748b;
        --border: #dbe3ee;
        --accent: #14b8a6;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .site-header {
        background: white;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 18px 32px;
      }

      .nav {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 80px 24px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 4rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #334155;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 32px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        .nav {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 18px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="nav">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Should<span>I</span>Spend</a>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/calculators">Calculators</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</div>

      <h1>Your Privacy Matters.</h1>

      <p>
        ShouldISpend respects your privacy and is committed to protecting any
        information collected while using this website.
      </p>

      <p>
        At this time, ShouldISpend does not require user accounts, collect
        sensitive financial information, or store personal calculator entries in
        a database.
      </p>

      <p>
        Basic anonymous analytics data may be collected in the future to improve
        website performance, usability, and content quality. This may include
        general information such as browser type, device type, pages visited,
        and approximate geographic region.
      </p>

      <p>
        ShouldISpend may use third-party services such as analytics providers,
        advertising platforms, or affiliate partners in the future. These
        services may use cookies or similar technologies to improve user
        experience and measure website performance.
      </p>

      <p>
        Users can disable cookies through their browser settings if preferred.
      </p>

      <p>
        By continuing to use this website, you acknowledge and agree to this
        privacy policy.
      </p>

      <p>
        This policy may be updated periodically as the website evolves and new
        features or services are introduced.
      </p>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
      ShouldISpend © 2026 — Practical financial decision tools and calculators.
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>